<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of English premier</p>
<p>league matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Arsenal 0 Coventry 0. Attendance: 38,140</p>
<p>Aston Villa 2 (Yorke 58, Johnson 65) Leeds 0. (halftime 0-0).</p>
<p>39,051</p>
<p>Chelsea 2 (Minto 9, Vialli 84 pen) Wimbledon 4 (Earle 4, Ardley</p>
<p>16, Gayle 64, Ekoku 78) 1-2. 28,020</p>
<p>Middlesbrough 0 Tottenham 3 (Sheringham 21, 90, Fox 23) 0-2.</p>
<p>30,215</p>
<p>Nottingham Forest 1 (Saunders 2) Derby 1 (Dailly 58) 1-0.</p>
<p>27,771</p>
<p>Sheffield Wednesday 1 (Booth 3) Blackburn 1 (Bohinen 74) 1-0.</p>
<p>22,191</p>
<p>Southampton 3 (Dodd 38, Le Tissier 53 pen, Shipperley 89)</p>
<p>Sunderland 0. 1-0. 15,225</p>
<p>West Ham 1 (Moncur 78) Leicester 0. 0-0. 22,285</p>
